        "heading": "[ edit L5a1 Quick Notes ]",
        "text": "L5a1 is [math]\\displaystyle{ 5^2_1 }[/math] in Rolfsen's Table of Links. It is also known as the \"Whitehead Link\". [ edit L5a1 Further Notes and Views ] Basic depiction Drawing of \"Thor's hammer\" or Mjölnir found in Sweden Wolfgang Staubach's medallion based on this [1] A kolam with two cycles, one of which is twisted [2] A simplest closed-loop version of heraldic \"fret\" / \"fretty\" ornamentation. Bisexuality symbol. Link Presentations [ edit Notes on L5a1's Link Presentations ] Planar diagram presentation",
        "source": "rendered-text-window"
